{"id":"nave:deacon","source":"nave","name":"Deacon","slug":"deacon","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"Selected by the people Ac 6:1-6","refs":[["Acts",6,1,6,6]]},{"text":"Characteristics of 1Ti 3:8-13","refs":[["1Tim",3,8,3,13]]},{"text":"The Greek word (diakonos) translated “deacon” means servant, and is so translated in Mt 23:11; Joh 12:26","refs":[["Matt",23,11,23,11],["John",12,26,12,26]]},{"text":"Also translated “minister,” Mr 10:43; 1Co 3:5; 1Th 3:2","refs":[["Mark",10,43,10,43],["1Cor",3,5,3,5],["1Thess",3,2,3,2]]}],"refCount":7}
